            <td valign="top" width="80%">Fully integrated Copper complex  from mining to  refining  came on stream at Khetri ( capacity 31,000 tonnes of refined copper)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
            <td valign="top" width="20%"><strong>November 1982</strong></td>
